{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰も聴いてないSPでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\n植田真梨恵さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたまご食べたい\nレモパ作ろう\nって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひじきスレとかね\n今回は笑いすぎて\n本当に腹筋が痛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金を一途に聴いてくれた人だけの\n特別な回でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、代々木来てくださったみなさん\nメールくれたみなさん\nなんとなく覚えてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\n46時間レポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田花奈 presents 乃木坂「踊ってみた」選手権"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間TV、中田やっと出ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルピーさんが来てくれたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、お誘いしたんだけど\n本当に来てくれて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒板アート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵は下手なんだけど\nれなちさんに教えてもらって頑張りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2時間くらいやってたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中継入った時に\nかずみんが奇跡を起こしてくれて\nさすがでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成が楽しみ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元々、出る予定は無かったんだけど\n暇だなーって思ったら出してもらえた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子校組\n真夏、玲香、若月、中田のユニット名を\n急遽、募集することにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♯女子校ユニット名\nってハッシュタグで募集してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き続き見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/2806859/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}